<title>USA: Spring Branch ISD, Texas, won by Interstate.</title>
<headline>Spring Branch ISD, Texas, won by Interstate.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson said it won $20 million of Spring Branch ISD, Texas, limited tax schoolhouse bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.112 percent.</p>
</text>
